   "resumo_en": "Aura is the seventh studio album by The Mission. Released in 2001, it was their first studio album since Blue in 1996. The album was also released as a slipcased limited edition 2-CD set. The bonus disc features the original version of \"In Denial\", two videos - \"Evangeline\" and \"Deliverance\" (live), interview footage and a weblink. The album was re-released in November 2014 together with its accompanying Aural Delight.",
